{"title":"2006 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/5/b15be6e317d137e5207899e27f63724aa0158938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=10}^{2006}\\binom{k}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"76\" height=\"53\" /> (Your answer should contain no summations but may still contain binomial coefficients/combinations).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hockey_Stick_Identity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hockey Stick Identity\">Hockey Stick Identity</a> that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e080a621c82760dd7c37df0fe66272943a8e6f5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=n}^{j}\\binom{i}{n}=\\binom{j+1}{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"158\" height=\"53\" />. Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7f3a27e56af8a748ea1558237babf916c8ce6fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=10}^{2006}\\binom{k}{10}=\\boxed{\\binom{2007}{11}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"180\" height=\"64\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Imagine a scenario in which there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/4944bcd1e5f1c6890c49160993314481c933217d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1996$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> identical objects distributed among <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> containers, where some objects may remain undistributed. By considering the number of objects that are actually placed into the containers, the number of ways to do this is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c740966722ab19147ad2a459fd874102fec48b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[{10 \\choose 10} + {11 \\choose 10} + {12 \\choose 10} + \\dots + {2006 \\choose 10},\\]\" width=\"313\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>or equivalently,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/6/a1621057e208ceae7e34d3e15b7776631c780b8c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=10}^{2006} {k \\choose 10}.\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>However, we can also count the same quantity another way. Add a twelfth imaginary container to hold all of the objects that are not distributed. Now all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/4944bcd1e5f1c6890c49160993314481c933217d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1996$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> objects are distributed among <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> containers, so by stars and bars, the number of ways is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46839f277684c9ba3991c5728458e5e9f2328a2e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[{1996+12-1 \\choose 12-1} = {2007 \\choose 11}.\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/c/ffc6db66d1049fa60f41450d6d6eef5ddd1918b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=10}^{2006} {k \\choose 10} = {2007 \\choose 11}.\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Note: Use only if you don't know Hockey Stick Identity\n</p><p>-mutou637\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems\" title=\"2006 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems\">2006 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211857\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2151/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11179:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211857 and revision id 288356. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}